    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that sounds pretty solid. i want to make sure the 'gates' part is really emphasized for the stakeholders. can you expand a bit on the specific 'automated testing' gates? what are the red flags that should trigger an immediate halt in the pipeline before it moves to staging?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
